        "section": "typography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "08 - Layout and Readability",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "WHY THERE'S AN OPTIMAL:\n  Too short:\n  - Each line requires frequent direction changes (eye tracks right → left)\n  - Justification becomes impossible without bad spacing or bad hyphenation\n  - Rhythm is choppy; reading feels mechanical\n  - Under ~30 chars: reading becomes significantly slower"
    },
    {
