        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "08 - Layout and Readability",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Too long:\n  - Eye must travel far to reach the next line start\n  - Risk of \"losing the line\": returning to wrong line\n  - Must use generous leading (more space between lines) to compensate\n  - Over ~90 chars: reading significantly slows; error increases"
    },
