        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MEASUREMENT:\n  Traditional: expressed in points (\"9/11\" = 9pt type on 11pt leading)\n  CSS: line-height property (unitless ratio OR absolute value OR percentage)\n  Relationship: if type is 16px and line-height is 1.5, spacing = 24px\n                half the extra 8px appears above, half below each line"
    },
